OL,3,AGoogle Cloud says services are
OL,4,Arecovering after outage hit banks,
OL,5,Abusinesses, and courts
OL,6,
OL,7,FGoogle says services are recovering for
OL,8,F"most workloads" after problems with
OL,9,Fits Cloud service affected banks, other
OL,10,Fbusinesses, and courts
OL,12,FRevolut, Halifax, HSBC, delivery
OL,13,Fservice DPD, and e-bike service Forest
OL,14,Fwere among the businesses affected
OL,16,FElsewhere, the courts service said its
OL,17,Fvideo links were affected - the
OL,18,FCriminal Bar Association said earlier
OL,19,Fthat prosecution and defence barristers
OL,20,Fin England and Wales could not "proceed
OL,21,Fwith trials and other hearings"
